[options]
[A.]
                                         <h2>Choice of the Furies (Thunder)<a href="#mission19">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                ~[IthunderCannon.36]
<br>
Meet the ~[ImanaBolt.1]~[ImanaBolt.2]~[ImanaBolt.0]Fury clan. This is the moment of all moments for your ally and
 master - King of the dark realm, {sw_hades}. Just remember, that even though you capture them (that is if you can) and
 sacrifice them, they still do not die. For you can only kill a Fury on his
 own turf - In the duesphere.
<br>
There are 3 referees ~[Ipriest.24]~[Ipriest.34]~[Ipriest.44] in this battle arena. They are neutral referees, meaning
 they will not attack you. They are there merely to declare a winner (and to
 make sure that you don't cheat).
<p>
Now, you are about to be given some choices (that is if the Furies decide to
 give them 2 you). You must choose wisely. As of now you are allied with the ~[ImanaBolt.2]Thunder Fury. Good Luck!
<br>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                  <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                              <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                            <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Enter Hades Realm</a>                    <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">I don't wanna Play</a>

<$PlaySound,somethingCreated.wav>
                     <h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god3}</h2>
<i>Ally, you must aid me in my, er, I mean our conquest. Do whatever it takes to win.</i>
<$AddRandom,100>     
<$PlaySound,forThunder2.wav>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,GolemMove2.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

[@2]
<$MoveDialog,tl>
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god5}.</h2>
<i>You will pay for turning traitor! I will make sure of that.</i>
<p>All of a sudden the skies turn dark and fill with mysterious clouds. You sense evil spirits floating all around you.
In the dark dense background you hear a familiar voice chanting. You recognize the voice - It is the {sw_god5}.His chants grow stronger<br>
~r~I"I call upon the power of Darkness. Give me the Power of the darkness. I cast the spell of ...~.
<p>All of a sudden you hear a loud noise.
<$PlaySound,forStorm2.wav>
$Button=What is Hades up to?,tell,spell1

